WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.560
I want to take up in Volume 12 from May the 10th, 1919, for as long as the divine will

2
00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:14.520
lasts in the soul, so does the divine life last within her.

3
00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:16.240
This is a very important statement.

4
00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:23.280
I mean, here it again, as long as the divine will last, so does the divine life last in

5
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:31.120
the soul. Louisa Sitch was very afflicted and worried about her state, and Jesus came

6
00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:35.680
