24
00:01:55.960 --> 00:02:01.640
"Then as though sighing," he said, "you do not know the ruin that the world will fall

25
00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:08.280
into, looking forward to World War II and World War III."

26
00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:13.000
And everything that has happened until now can be called a game compared to the chastisements

27
